":"Eight and forty cities with extensive suburbs, appointed for","r":["NUM 35:2-8"]},{"l":1,"t":"The tithes given to, for their support","r":["NUM 18:21","NUM 18:24","2CH 31:4","2CH 31:5","NEH 12:44","NEH 12:45","HEB 7:5"]},{"l":1,"t":"Bound to give a tenth of their tithes to the priests","r":["NUM 18:26-32"]},{"l":1,"t":"Had a part of their offerings","r":["DEU 18:1","DEU 18:2"]},{"l":1,"t":"David","r":[]},{"l":2,"t":"Numbered them first from thirty years old","r":["1CH 23:2-3"]},{"l":2,"t":"Divided them into four classed","r":["1CH 23:4-6"]},{"l":2,"t":"By his last words had them numbered from twenty years old","r":["1CH 23:24","1CH 23:27"]},{"l":2,"t":"Made them serve from twenty on account of the lightness of their duties","r":["1CH 23:26","1CH 23:28-32"]},{"l":2,"t":"Subdivided into 24 courses","r":["1CH 23:6","1CH 25:8-31"]},{"l":2,"t":"Made them attend in courses","r":["2CH 8:14","2CH 31:17"]},{"l":1,"t":"Served in courses after captivity","r":["EZR 6:18"]},{"l":1,"t":"Had chiefs or officers over them","r":["NUM 3:24","NUM 3:30","NUM 3:35","1CH 15:4-10","2CH 35:9","EZR 8:29"]},{"l":1,"t":"Were all under control of the high priest’s deputy","r":["NUM 3:32","1CH 9:20"]},{"l":1,"t":"While in attendance lodged around the temple","r":["1CH 9:27"]},{"l":1,"t":"Punished with death for encroaching on the priestly office","r":["NUM 18:3"]},{"l":1,"t":"Punishment of Korah and others of, for offering incense","r":["NUM 16:1-35"]}]}
